# Fab OS system-wide default applications (XDG mime-apps spec, consulted after the user's ~/.config/mimeapps.list, which
# Settings > Default Applications writes). Firefox is the browser Fab OS ships (docs/decisions/ADR-0018-firefox-returns.md);
# the desktop file name comes from Mozilla's official firefox package (usr/share/applications/firefox.desktop).
[Default Applications]
x-scheme-handler/http=firefox.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=firefox.desktop
text/html=firefox.desktop
application/xhtml+xml=firefox.desktop
